                        "review": "Runner game in which you control a pixel, avoid obstacles and enemies, and defeat subsequent levels and bosses\n\n✅Combination of running, jumping and changing lanes\n\n❌No meaningful progression, upgrades or content unlocking system\n❌Gameplay quickly becomes repetitive\n❌Stripes and obstacles are visually too similar to each other\n❌Low variety of obstacles and gameplay patterns\n❌The price is too high\n❌The graphics are ugly\n\n❌❌ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [b] Bad [/b], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [strike] Good [/strike], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for the game tested)\n\n[quote]If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand in my group: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask. I'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!! Best regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
